        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsung Escape</i> is a vertical action-platformer where you outrun an ever-rising Void. Use Energy Orbs to gain movement abilities like double-jumps and dashes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies—just pure platforming, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proto and Eye... or is it Eye and Proto?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Proto the heroic silent protagonist of Unsung Escape... but if you ask Eye he's the star of the game! Sassy and maybe a little unhinged from his time in The Null you never know what's going to come out of his <span class=\"bb_strike\">mouth</span> or ummmm speaker? next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Vertical Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by the incredible Tyler Carr from the Energy 106 Morning Show with Dave Wheeler,  Eye will definitely let you know how you're doing as you race up these procedurally generated vertical levels as you attempt to escape The Void constantly nipping at Proto's heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for... Start Escaping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsung Escape</i> is a vertical action-platformer where you outrun an ever-rising Void. Use Energy Orbs to gain movement abilities like double-jumps and dashes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies—just pure platforming, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proto and Eye... or is it Eye and Proto?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Proto the heroic silent protagonist of Unsung Escape... but if you ask Eye he's the star of the game! Sassy and maybe a little unhinged from his time in The Null you never know what's going to come out of his <span class=\"bb_strike\">mouth</span> or ummmm speaker? next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Vertical Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by the incredible Tyler Carr from the Energy 106 Morning Show with Dave Wheeler,  Eye will definitely let you know how you're doing as you race up these procedurally generated vertical levels as you attempt to escape The Void constantly nipping at Proto's heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for... Start Escaping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
